      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clarkston%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Clarkston serves as the burial place for Martin Harris, one of the Three Witnesses of the Book of Mormon.",
